PART 7 - FILE PERMISSIONS
====================================================================

Create file:

touch app.log


Check permissions:

ls -l app.log


Change permissions:

chmod 640 app.log


Change ownership:

sudo chown devops:devops app.log


Check again:

ls -l app.log


PERMISSION EXPLANATION:

640

Owner:
rw-

Group:
r--

Others:
---


Common permissions:

600 = Owner read/write
644 = Owner read/write, others read
755 = Owner full, others read/execute
777 = Full permissions for everyone

Avoid using 777 unnecessarily.


